1
00:00:00,190 --> 00:00:04,328
“Why so happy? Now
you'll work under him.”

2
00:00:04,858 --> 00:00:09,480
One line of office politics… and
five years of friendship went cold.

3
00:00:10,190 --> 00:00:14,140
That day, Rohan got promoted…
and Kavya handed out the mithai.

4
00:00:14,909 --> 00:00:18,609
Now Rohan's “Lunch?”… has
been on seen for three days.

5
00:00:19,201 --> 00:00:23,190
One whisper… and a friend
starts to feel like a rival.…

6
00:00:23,190 --> 00:00:25,636
The Ramayana saw this too.

7
00:00:25,676 --> 00:00:29,626
At Rama's coronation news… a happy
Kaikeyi gave Manthara a jewel.

8
00:00:29,783 --> 00:00:31,983
Manthara flung it down—

9
00:00:31,983 --> 00:00:36,053
“Why celebrate? Now Bharata
will live under Rama.”

10
00:00:36,523 --> 00:00:40,723
The same words, again and again…
and in one night, Kaikeyi changed.

11
00:00:41,009 --> 00:00:43,709
Yet Kaikeyi herself had said —

12
00:00:43,749 --> 00:00:47,721
“Between Rama and Bharata…
I see no difference.”

13
00:00:48,731 --> 00:00:52,131
“I see no difference
between Rama and Bharata.”…

14
00:00:52,131 --> 00:00:54,081
Vishesha means difference.

15
00:00:54,204 --> 00:00:57,154
The answer was in
her own experience…

16
00:00:57,154 --> 00:00:59,604
but someone else's voice won.

17
00:01:00,264 --> 00:01:04,595
Kavya didn't argue… she
asked Rohan directly— “Chai?”

18
00:01:05,105 --> 00:01:07,305
Next time someone whispers…

19
00:01:07,305 --> 00:01:10,255
ask first— “What
have I seen myself?”

20
00:01:10,595 --> 00:01:14,295
What would you do… ask directly,
or keep your distance?…

21
00:01:14,295 --> 00:01:17,995
Send this to the friend
whose office has a Manthara.
